{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：11:00 2026-09-09 HKT</p>\n\n<p>2022年港姐季軍梁超怡近日在社交平台大派福利，以一襲極具女人味的性感晚裝驚艷亮相。照片中的她身穿剪裁大膽的貼身晚裝長裙，展現白皙迷人的肌膚，胸前半透明薄紗設計，將豐滿身材盡現眼前，貼身晚裝的收腰剪裁，將她「葫蘆身形」展露無遺，舉手投足間散發著輕熟女神的致命誘惑，火辣晚裝造型曝光後，隨即引來網民紛紛大讚「氣質女神」。</p>\n<h2>梁超怡6歲時演過梁朝偉女兒</h2>\n<p>事實上，29歲的梁超怡自出道起便備受矚目，早於2002年僅6歲時便以童星身分參演經典電影《無間道》，飾演梁朝偉的女兒「陳玥琪」。贏得港姐季軍後簽約TVB，她不僅參與《自然系女子旅行3》，在節目中大晒比堅尼泳照，俘虜不少網民。她亦有拍攝劇集，除了首部劇集《黑色月光》及《非常檢控觀》外，在《正義女神》中更以29歲之齡逆齡挑戰「少年犯」何嘉茵一角，演技備受讚賞。</p>\n<img alt=\"現年29歲的梁超怡是2022年港姐季軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6cbc041027320f8179956f394510a3b/2024-02/309345420_605204031063055_9175232973538606233_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡6歲已做童星。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/014d4dc29d368c9b1e2707fbf99b5fbd/2023-08/Joey_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡近日在社交平台分享靚相，換上一襲性感貼身晚裝，大展優雅迷人的女神氣質。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d01ce96b8ce11d5d802a43ec37a77459/2026-09/SaveClip_App_799503092_18127468831796656_7102045947958755527_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡的晚裝貼身剪裁，完美勾勒出S形曲線，傲人身材展露無遺。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/792287cb8c38dbce48893830622a95da/2026-09/SaveClip_App_799570663_18127468855796656_7350351538797172124_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡對著鏡頭甜笑，精緻五官與豐滿身材，電力十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6ff5ff5c9207348444c5e450e5f7397/2026-09/SaveClip_App_799601297_18127468813796656_5830296431626145814_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡舉手投足散發成熟女人味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d4f4421c9c626c0dec16b4afa354636a/2026-09/SaveClip_App_799674518_18127468822796656_7999351632565769595_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡一襲高貴晚裝搭配自信儀態，火辣狀態獲網民一致盛讚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0a41e87d012fbbbf8f7dea68b2690e8/2026-09/SaveClip_App_799782338_18127468783796656_5862694451882055390_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡在港產片《無間道》飾演梁朝偉的女兒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/40a050c755bdeca294a230e488089f1d/2023-08/Joey_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡曾與劉德華、劉偉強及林建岳等一起到尖沙咀出席電影《無間道》20周年4K修復版巨幕特典場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/30b96eabea4571e11d18ebdc6b807bb3/2022-12/photo1670860220.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡早前上載比堅尼靚相加盟《自然系女子旅行3》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22a14fad8842161e6b21f0d1ebd84d26/2026-03/1_9_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡和林映暉拍檔主持。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/73488e3ed506957ffed735c190b4a957/2026-03/1__9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡曾傳介入石恆聰與阿Sa戀情，其後阿Sa證清分手不涉及第三者。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/00f03bfed2aae1cf843bdaef8fbf269a/2025-04/WhatsApp_Image_2025-04-01_at_7_55_07_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡身材頗為驕人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af783acde8ec59e1d4bdd9e7d2e4f906/2026-03/P.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡十分火辣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f88677ff21d63be7ab89e1f61cbca6b/2026-03/Q.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡是香港小姐季軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42a5ae0d2d2ecadaba834b7e0ed146fb/2026-03/S.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡保持曝光率。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83fef8f889eaa9e5aa54cfdd234ec3bf/2023-08/Joey_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡是2022年的港姐三甲中最早獲安排拍劇的一位，在《非常檢控觀》飾陳煒的年輕版。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/25fa556567cc0b9d27e8fa40eb4a4905/2023-03/photo1680249546%20%2818%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡主持節目《周六聊Teen谷》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/751190834368f9c1b59601aa33267b1b/2023-08/cecca_4_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡（左）在節目《不可能任務》做幕後工作人員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20e2fef12faee34de3a359ccbea6bf5d/2023-08/Joey_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡主持節目《身體最誠實》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a49530a6ac24fe94012261ef540278cc/2023-08/Joey_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌（Bob）早前領軍到澳門拍TVB遊戲節目《濠玩夏水禮》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1751e0aa55f51cdc355986634875c7b/2024-05/bob_lamshingbun_1716181332_3371895867270812894_1775833454.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌率先分享與六位穿上索爆泳衣的女藝人合照，卻驚見周志康與旁邊穿上火辣比堅尼的梁超怡非常親密。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe1a01ea4d7a850ba2318b65b8430ed2/2024-05/bob_lamshingbun_1716517141_3374712837880096142_1775833454.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"去年梁超怡28歲生日，她都有在社交網分享生日會片段。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd0d3ca17198dab23e693b5a0eb3d63a/2024-09/chiuyiileung_1726156484_3455573504765403434_23821252655.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"壽星女梁超怡手捧鮮花心情大好，又向鏡頭舉V派飛吻，非常風騷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b186baebaddbf5ece72e31afffa8f79/2024-09/VS--ChiuyiLeungchiuyiileungInstagram-0_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡俯身吹蠟燭時，豐滿上圍呼之欲出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4cba554d4981a887476e80337f1d59c7/2024-09/VS--ChiuyiLeungchiuyiileungInstagram-0_00_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡坐在背景板前一張餐桌，與人碰杯飲香檳，但旁邊座位全沒人坐，似乎是與人單獨撐枱腳\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e50e161f2f3b023a31d2a28ebbab5376/2024-09/VS--ChiuyiLeungchiuyiileungInstagram-0_02_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡對鏡頭展示甜美笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a93ca90b43b0869b0596d8e20a9e3f93/2024-09/VS--ChiuyiLeungchiuyiileungInstagram-0_03_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡不時撥弄秀髮，意態撩人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4dd2494fb761627c477e425fe9e8f7a/2024-09/VS--ChiuyiLeungchiuyiileungInstagram-0_04_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"另一張照片則見到梁超怡在另一場地，身穿入膊掛項蝴蝶結貼身打扮，在餐廳內含着叉子準備吃蛋糕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e2edf63336490a7c0a10209992aeebaf/2024-09/chiuyiileung_1726156484_3455573504538736092_23821252655.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"港姐梁超怡早前被傳介入阿Sa感情，但出席錄影時拒絕受訪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c4be24aca4b1c3bdc8a7bbc22d3576fb/2023-10/FotoJet2_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡博到盡玩啜乒乓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/14bc6a57d3129f2b391b4dd25fec79d7/2023-10/KakaoTalk_20231010_234220164_27.jpg\"/>\n<h2>梁超怡曾捲入蔡卓妍分手風波</h2>\n<p>梁超怡曾一度捲入蔡卓妍（阿Sa）與富家子前男友石恆聰的分手風波，被外界盛傳為第三者。對此梁超怡曾多次澄清雙方純屬朋友關係，絕無介入他人戀情；而阿Sa隨後亦公開回應「我們之間沒有第三者」，終為梁超怡洗脫污名。</p>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡是2022年港姐季軍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07d959f563b3ebc409152d69fd0d1462/2023-08/Joey_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡曾分享與郭嘉文合體跳舞的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3778007edf19f092cda3852c47cef6a2/2023-10/K1_8.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡相當戰鬥格。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3dcbc6c36ba9ccf476e072259c6a3a3/2023-10/K4_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡早前分享出海照，穿上白恤衫竟有一邊完全跌出香肩，令玲瓏浮凸上圍若隱若現，再加上她的白滑肌膚，及極度誘人的搔首弄姿撥頭髮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/40219a00a418625259780db6157fe20d/2024-02/203_12.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"穿上性感毛毛低胸桃紅長衣的她，一隻手托腮，另一隻手放在胸前，梁超怡的豐滿上圍更加立體，加埋她的單眼甜美樣子，極之吸眼球。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b93c1dd503db9591c39d27a4df8823c/2024-02/427014734_2076948325999674_5737914002081157118_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡直至近期才經常在IG派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6ea17cea4976ae79061178960d86ae3/2024-05/chiuyiileung_1715001763_3362000928617724610_23821252655.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡谷胸上陣晒晚裝和穿婚紗的照片，令網民大為驚喜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e89218ebb1817e4aff9a027efde1fa1a/2024-05/chiuyiileung_1710836720_3327062009665069045_23821252655.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡大晒螞蟻腰，十分吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85aed21376696bd8c7d14f68d7da3f8e/2024-05/chiuyiileung_1715695614_3367821373371715057_23821252655.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡也不時賣萌！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/660745eed62987a24e5bc03a89380df0/2024-02/501_13.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"個子不高的梁超怡，勝在樣子甜美，上圍豐滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17db80f1a371db8e1cad3a545aea3ed4/2024-02/300_6.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡早前到歐洲旅遊分享不少靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e522b2c08eba8fad7a5d32ed3229e942/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡不時旅行打卡，\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/af342bd67d6d9d4c957e37ac1918c2a9/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡在IG上密密晒出歐遊靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25fd88729758415c0321c444fc516719/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡經常周遊列國。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/40ec7c0015a20e10f0fb55b9296536c9/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡日前在IG上又PO出另一輯美照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ceaf7b54bbe63e48752267716db73b64/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM_7_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"穿上一身黑色貼身長裙，大騷苗條葫蘆身材，長腿美背展露無遺，令網民流晒鼻血！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c7800c992e40a4398a22ed389521c16/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM_6_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"穿上一身黑色貼身長裙，大騷苗條葫蘆身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/91a6c0e289e6b802e34feb5b6cacc39b/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM_5_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"正面望落包到實一實，實則後面是大露背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/64da2feac2bf466dbce3cbb6818b06a9/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM_4_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"S形曲線表露無遺！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9d496f85d1243fa34d277d52614fcb3/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM_13_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡大騷長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/814755a886983f1141edca7040889261/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM_12_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民紛紛大讚其身形好弗，性感火辣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5f9ad5baeac920fdcc079a9ddb575197/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM_11_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡包豪車出遊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de42fcc6c2cd409cfc133b742acb9505/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM_9_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梁超怡長裙呈半透明，若隱若現。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/310d23e2f82ee2651b28cf9c1dd658db/2024-08/WhatsApp_Image_2024-08-22_at_4_10_49_PM_8_.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T06:39:53.257932+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":497,"images":54,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}